{
  "id": "JOS.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "JOS",
  "reference": "Joshua 15",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 63,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Allotment for Judah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The allotment for the tribe of Judah, according to its clans, extended down to the territory of Edom, to the Desert of Zin in the extreme south.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their southern boundary started from the bay at the southern end of the Dead Sea,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "crossed south of Scorpion Pass, continued on to Zin and went over to the south of Kadesh Barnea. Then it ran past Hezron up to Addar and curved around to Karka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It then passed along to Azmon and joined the Wadi of Egypt, ending at the Mediterranean Sea. This is their",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "southern boundary.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The eastern boundary is the Dead Sea as far as the mouth of the Jordan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1",
        "vid": "JOS 15:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The northern boundary started from the bay of the sea at the mouth of the Jordan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "went up to Beth Hoglah and continued north of Beth Arabah to the Stone of Bohan son of Reuben.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The boundary then went up to Debir from the Valley of Achor and turned north to Gilgal, which faces the Pass of Adummim south of the gorge. It continued along to the waters of En Shemesh and came out at En Rogel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then it ran up the Valley of Ben Hinnom along the southern slope of the Jebusite city (that is, Jerusalem). From there it climbed to the top of the hill west of the Hinnom Valley at the northern end of the Valley of Rephaim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the hilltop the boundary headed toward the spring of the waters of Nephtoah, came out at the towns of Mount Ephron and went down toward Baalah (that is, Kiriath Jearim).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then it curved westward from Baalah to Mount Seir, ran along the northern slope of Mount Jearim (that is, Kesalon), continued down to Beth Shemesh and crossed to Timnah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It went to the northern slope of Ekron, turned toward Shikkeron, passed along to Mount Baalah and reached Jabneel. The boundary ended at the sea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The western boundary is the coastline of the Mediterranean Sea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "JOS 15:12"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lf",
        "vid": "JOS 15:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "These are the boundaries around the people of Judah by their clans.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In accordance with the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.15.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.15.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s command to him, Joshua gave to Caleb son of Jephunneh a portion in Judah—Kiriath Arba, that is, Hebron. (Arba was the forefather of Anak.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From Hebron Caleb drove out the three Anakites—Sheshai, Ahiman and Talmai, the sons of Anak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From there he marched against the people living in Debir (formerly called Kiriath Sepher).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Caleb said, \"I will give my daughter Aksah in marriage to the man who attacks and captures Kiriath Sepher.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Othniel son of Kenaz, Caleb's brother, took it; so Caleb gave his daughter Aksah to him in marriage.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One day when she came to Othniel, she urged him",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "to ask her father for a field. When she got off her donkey, Caleb asked her, \"What can I do for you?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She replied, \"Do me a special favor. Since you have given me land in the Negev, give me also springs of water.\" So Caleb gave her the upper and lower springs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "lh"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the inheritance of the tribe of Judah, according to its clans:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The southernmost towns of the tribe of Judah in the Negev toward the boundary of Edom were:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "JOS 15:21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kabzeel, Eder, Jagur,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinah, Dimonah, Adadah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedesh, Hazor, Ithnan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ziph, Telem, Bealoth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hazor Hadattah, Kerioth Hezron (that is, Hazor),",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amam, Shema, Moladah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hazar Gaddah, Heshmon, Beth Pelet,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hazar Shual, Beersheba, Biziothiah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalah, Iyim, Ezem,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eltolad, Kesil, Hormah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ziklag, Madmannah, Sansannah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
